<div class="acc acc--boxed acc--icon-right" data-single="true" style="--a-border-size:0px;--a-icon-size:20px;--a-content-font-size:16px;--a-icon-alignment:right;--a-hover-color:#f9f9fb;--a-border-color:#e2e2e2;--a-background-color:#ffffff;--a-divider-color:#e8ebef;--a-divider-hover-color:#e8ebef;--a-icon-color:#046e77;--a-title-color:#01a4a8;--a-content-color:#59667d;--a-icon-box-color:rgba(33,41,52,0);--a-toggle-hover-accent-color:#01a4a8;--a-title-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-title-font-weight:700;--a-title-font-style:normal;--a-title-font-size:21px;--a-content-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-content-font-style:normal;--a-content-font-weight:400"><div class="acc__panel acc__panel--divider"><h4 class="acc__title"><button type="button" class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a6"><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="acc__plus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32l0 160-160 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l160 0 0 160c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160 160 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-160 0 0-160z"/></svg><svg class="acc__minus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l384 0c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32L32 288c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32z"/></svg></span><span class="acc__heading">Why do I have to register my personal email?</span></button></h4>
<div class="acc__body" id="a6" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p>It is required to provide your email address in case you need to reset your password or if you forgot your username.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="acc acc--boxed acc--icon-right" data-single="true" style="--a-border-size:0px;--a-icon-size:20px;--a-content-font-size:16px;--a-icon-alignment:right;--a-hover-color:#f9f9fb;--a-border-color:#e2e2e2;--a-background-color:#ffffff;--a-divider-color:#e8ebef;--a-divider-hover-color:#e8ebef;--a-icon-color:#046e77;--a-title-color:#01a4a8;--a-content-color:#59667d;--a-icon-box-color:rgba(33,41,52,0);--a-toggle-hover-accent-color:#01a4a8;--a-title-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-title-font-weight:700;--a-title-font-style:normal;--a-title-font-size:21px;--a-content-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-content-font-style:normal;--a-content-font-weight:400"><div class="acc__panel acc__panel--divider"><h4 class="acc__title"><button type="button" class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a7"><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="acc__plus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32l0 160-160 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l160 0 0 160c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160 160 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-160 0 0-160z"/></svg><svg class="acc__minus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l384 0c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32L32 288c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32z"/></svg></span><span class="acc__heading">How do I monitor my transactions once I am registered?</span></button></h4>
<div class="acc__body" id="a7" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p>You can start using the service immediately. By toggling the small green button in the upper right corner of the card image, it will turn red. This means that all transactions will be declined (except recurring transactions). When you are ready to make a purchase, simply turn the button back on. It’s that easy. You can activate and deactivate your card according to your convenience and needs.</p>
<p>Selectively enable controls and alerts by channel (in-store, online, mobile, ATM, etc.). You can also set transaction spending limits, choose geographic locations where the card can be used, define specific merchant categories, view recent transaction history, receive real-time alerts, and much more.</p>
<p>It is ideal for managing corporate cards, college students, and individual users!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col" data-anim="fadeInLeft" data-anim-dur="1.0" style="--w:50%;--sl:3.84%;--sr:9.6%;--mt:20px;--mb:20px;--w-md:50%;--sl-md:3.84%;--sr-md:9.6%;--w-sm:100%;--sl-sm:1.92%;--sr-sm:1.92%;--cbc:#dee1e4;--cbs:solid;--cbw-t:0px;--cbw-r:0px;--cbw-b:0px;--cbw-l:0px;--cr:8px 8px 8px 8px;--cov:hidden"><div class="col__in"><div class="acc acc--boxed acc--icon-right" data-single="true" style="--a-border-size:0px;--a-icon-size:20px;--a-content-font-size:16px;--a-icon-alignment:right;--a-hover-color:#f9f9fb;--a-border-color:#e2e2e2;--a-background-color:#ffffff;--a-divider-color:#e8ebef;--a-divider-hover-color:#e8ebef;--a-icon-color:#046e77;--a-title-color:#01a4a8;--a-content-color:#59667d;--a-icon-box-color:rgba(33,41,52,0);--a-toggle-hover-accent-color:#01a4a8;--a-title-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-title-font-weight:700;--a-title-font-style:normal;--a-title-font-size:21px;--a-content-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-content-font-style:normal;--a-content-font-weight:400"><div class="acc__panel acc__panel--divider"><h4 class="acc__title"><button type="button" class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a8"><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="acc__plus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32l0 160-160 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l160 0 0 160c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160 160 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-160 0 0-160z"/></svg><svg class="acc__minus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l384 0c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32L32 288c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32z"/></svg></span><span class="acc__heading">What is a real-time alert?</span></button></h4>
<div class="acc__body" id="a8" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p>It is a notification sent to your phone every time you use any of your registered cards. You may choose to receive a notification for every transaction, payment reminders or preferred transactions. The alerts can be set up using the SecurLock’s notification preferences within the app.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="acc acc--boxed acc--icon-right" data-single="true" style="--a-border-size:0px;--a-icon-size:20px;--a-content-font-size:16px;--a-icon-alignment:right;--a-hover-color:#f9f9fb;--a-border-color:#e2e2e2;--a-background-color:#ffffff;--a-divider-color:#e8ebef;--a-divider-hover-color:#e8ebef;--a-icon-color:#046e77;--a-title-color:#01a4a8;--a-content-color:#59667d;--a-icon-box-color:rgba(33,41,52,0);--a-toggle-hover-accent-color:#01a4a8;--a-title-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-title-font-weight:700;--a-title-font-style:normal;--a-title-font-size:21px;--a-content-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-content-font-style:normal;--a-content-font-weight:400"><div class="acc__panel acc__panel--divider"><h4 class="acc__title"><button type="button" class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a9"><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="acc__plus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32l0 160-160 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l160 0 0 160c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160 160 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-160 0 0-160z"/></svg><svg class="acc__minus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l384 0c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32L32 288c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32z"/></svg></span><span class="acc__heading">How long does it take for changes in the app to become effective?</span></button></h4>
<div class="acc__body" id="a9" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p>Changes will become effective Immediately after changing your settings. Remember to save every time you make changes!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="acc acc--boxed acc--icon-right" data-single="true" style="--a-border-size:0px;--a-icon-size:20px;--a-content-font-size:16px;--a-icon-alignment:right;--a-hover-color:#f9f9fb;--a-border-color:#e2e2e2;--a-background-color:#ffffff;--a-divider-color:#e8ebef;--a-divider-hover-color:#e8ebef;--a-icon-color:#046e77;--a-title-color:#01a4a8;--a-content-color:#59667d;--a-icon-box-color:rgba(33,41,52,0);--a-toggle-hover-accent-color:#01a4a8;--a-title-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-title-font-weight:700;--a-title-font-style:normal;--a-title-font-size:21px;--a-content-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-content-font-style:normal;--a-content-font-weight:400"><div class="acc__panel acc__panel--divider"><h4 class="acc__title"><button type="button" class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a10"><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="acc__plus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32l0 160-160 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l160 0 0 160c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160 160 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-160 0 0-160z"/></svg><svg class="acc__minus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l384 0c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32L32 288c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32z"/></svg></span><span class="acc__heading">Are new FACEBANK cards added automatically?</span></button></h4>
<div class="acc__body" id="a10" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<div>No, you must manually add your new cards in the option<strong>Administrar Cuenta</strong>, include the details of your new card and make sure to<strong>de-select</strong>the previous card</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
