<div class="acc__body" id="a12" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p>To log out just press the three-lined icon on the top right of the application and press log out.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="acc acc--boxed acc--icon-right" data-single="true" style="--a-border-size:0px;--a-icon-size:20px;--a-content-font-size:16px;--a-icon-alignment:right;--a-hover-color:#f9f9fb;--a-border-color:#e2e2e2;--a-background-color:#ffffff;--a-divider-color:#e8ebef;--a-divider-hover-color:#e8ebef;--a-icon-color:#046e77;--a-title-color:#01a4a8;--a-content-color:#59667d;--a-icon-box-color:rgba(33,41,52,0);--a-toggle-hover-accent-color:#01a4a8;--a-title-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-title-font-weight:700;--a-title-font-style:normal;--a-title-font-size:21px;--a-content-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-content-font-style:normal;--a-content-font-weight:400"><div class="acc__panel acc__panel--divider"><h4 class="acc__title"><button type="button" class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a13"><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="acc__plus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32l0 160-160 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l160 0 0 160c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160 160 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-160 0 0-160z"/></svg><svg class="acc__minus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l384 0c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32L32 288c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32z"/></svg></span><span class="acc__heading">What happens if my phone is stolen or lost?</span></button></h4>
<div class="acc__body" id="a13" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p>The SecureLock  requires a password to access the app. Additionally, no sensitive information is stored in your phone. It only saves the last 4 digits of your cards.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="acc acc--boxed acc--icon-right" data-single="true" style="--a-border-size:0px;--a-icon-size:20px;--a-content-font-size:16px;--a-icon-alignment:right;--a-hover-color:#f9f9fb;--a-border-color:#e2e2e2;--a-background-color:#ffffff;--a-divider-color:#e8ebef;--a-divider-hover-color:#e8ebef;--a-icon-color:#046e77;--a-title-color:#01a4a8;--a-content-color:#59667d;--a-icon-box-color:rgba(33,41,52,0);--a-toggle-hover-accent-color:#01a4a8;--a-title-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-title-font-weight:700;--a-title-font-style:normal;--a-title-font-size:21px;--a-content-font-family:var(--fb-font);--a-content-font-style:normal;--a-content-font-weight:400"><div class="acc__panel acc__panel--divider"><h4 class="acc__title"><button type="button" class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a14"><span class="acc__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="acc__plus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32l0 160-160 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l160 0 0 160c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160 160 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-160 0 0-160z"/></svg><svg class="acc__minus" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l384 0c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32L32 288c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32z"/></svg></span><span class="acc__heading">With SecurLock do I have to notify FACEBANK of my travels?</span></button></h4>
<div class="acc__body" id="a14" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p>Yes, you should still notify FACEBANK prior to any trips to avoid any inconvenience. SecureLock does not replace the process. To notify us of any future travels, call us using any of the numbers listed at the bottom of the page.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
